{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967090/extras/3f3e6ea3a7ac9a3f5a5f1c464fad47e9.webp?t=1757670850\" width=26 height=23 /></span><strong>Meet Pixie!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Pixie\u00a0</strong>\u2014 the strip club star who's about to give you the most seductive private dance of your life. Her dangling earrings shimmer hypnotically, golden glitter sparkles on her fair skin... Just a few more big bills, and <strong>Pixie\u00a0</strong>will slide off even her tiniest panties just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixie\u00a0</strong>enjoys good old-fashioned sex. But what she lacks in kink, she more than makes up for with her talent for transformation: want a Mistress? <strong>Pixie\u00a0</strong>becomes one for you. Dreaming of a soft, innocent princess?.. Well, <strong>Pixie\u00a0</strong>can do that too \u2014 and afterward, she'll even listen to you vent about how complicated life has been lately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967090/extras/39780ff9f3699f65ed94764d88a0c0bd.webp?t=1757670850\" width=616 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967090/extras/3f3e6ea3a7ac9a3f5a5f1c464fad47e9.webp?t=1757670850\" width=26 height=23 /></span><strong>WHAT YOU'RE GETTING?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you unlock <strong>Pixie\u00a0</strong>in her night dancer look. You can change your mascot at any time by opening your profile in-game and selecting the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with the mascot, you'll also receive 5000 Credits and 150 Super Serum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly, you'll have our heartfelt thanks! We truly appreciate your support and hope you enjoy this DLC!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967090?t=1757670850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967090?t=1757670850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967090/527ac77b9305521a1d52db92adf73a1901c9944b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757670850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967090/527ac77b9305521a1d52db92adf73a1901c9944b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757670850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old. This DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967090/extras/3f3e6ea3a7ac9a3f5a5f1c464fad47e9.webp?t=1757670850\" width=26 height=23 /></span><strong>Meet Pixie!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Pixie\u00a0</strong>\u2014 the strip club star who's about to give you the most seductive private dance of your life. Her dangling earrings shimmer hypnotically,